# API keys for pcb-ai's hosted-model calls.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` in this same directory (pcb-ai/) and fill in whichever key
# you have — you do not need all of them. `.env` is gitignored; `.env.example` is the
# tracked template, so a fresh clone always has something to copy.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Loaded by `--env-file-if-exists=.env`, a Node 24 builtin (this repo already requires
# Node 24) — no dotenv package, and no error if the file is absent, which is right for
# every clone that has no key at all. It is wired into three places, and all three need
# to keep loading it the same way if this ever changes:
#
#   package.json  "design" / "stub" / "cad:check" scripts   (npm run design ...)
#   ui/app.py     TSX constant                              (the console's design runs)
#
# **Local models need none of this.** `--model coder-next`, `--model nemotron`, and
# `--model stub` all talk to servers on this box and read no key from here. This file
# is only for the hosted fallback paths — right now, specifically, the PCB↔CAD
# integration reviewer (`src/cad/integration-check.ts`), which defaults to
# `anthropic:claude-opus-5` and needs ANTHROPIC_API_KEY to run as shipped.
#
# If you only have a Gemini key: the reviewer's *coded default* is still Claude, so
# running it with no --model flag will report "integration review unavailable" until
# either ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is set or you pass a Gemini spec explicitly:
#
#   npm run cad:check -- <circuit.json> --model=google-genai:gemini-3.7-flash
#
# Fill in GEMINI_API_KEY below and that command works today. Say the word if you'd
# rather the reviewer default *to* Gemini instead of Claude — it's a one-line change
# in integration-check.ts, just not one to make silently on your behalf.

# --- Google Gemini ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Either name works; @langchain/google-genai only reads GOOGLE_API_KEY natively, but
# this repo's model layer checks GEMINI_API_KEY too, since that's the name Google's own
# docs and quickstart use. Get one at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# --- Anthropic (Claude) ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Needed for the PCB↔CAD integration reviewer's default model, anthropic:claude-opus-5.
# https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# --- OpenAI ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=
